{"unit_id":"Gorkaseto__dsh-markdownize#card-zh","repo":"Gorkaseto/dsh-markdownize","commit":"efccbcc4b158c6a4f96c6727c3384dc32ee073a3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-markdownize 是供 DSH 网页端使用的本地文档转 Markdown 插件。它注册 convert_to_markdown 工具，也提供转换引擎设置页和快捷预览。工具可将 PDF、Word、PowerPoint、Excel、HTML、CSV、JSON、XML、文本及 ZIP 转成 Markdown；DOCX 和 PPTX 中的图片可按设置作为模型附件。插件默认使用内置 JavaScript 引擎，也可选择已安装的 Microsoft MarkItDown。适合希望让模型读取本地文档或先预览转换结果的 DSH 用户；额外引擎需本机安装 MarkItDown。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:129-149","index.js:162-179","client.js:4-18"]}
{"unit_id":"Gorkaseto__dsh-markdownize#card-en","repo":"Gorkaseto/dsh-markdownize","commit":"efccbcc4b158c6a4f96c6727c3384dc32ee073a3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-markdownize converts local PDF, Office, HTML, CSV, JSON, text, and ZIP files to Markdown for DSH. It registers a conversion tool and preview shortcut, with a bundled JavaScript engine or optional local Microsoft MarkItDown. DOCX and PPTX images can be attached to models that accept images.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:129-149","index.js:162-179","client.js:4-18"]}
